Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.78,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty & Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.24,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Pa Pa Panty STOCKING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:13.45,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.23,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,We're the baddest, no fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.54,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,let the ghosts appear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.83,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Lock and load, baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,we takin' the lead here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty n Stocking, Panty n Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,(We) Wreck this system,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,our power is extreme
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.09,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.27,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty & Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:29.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,New!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.23,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,飛揚跋扈 無所畏懼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.54,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,惡靈儘管肆虐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.83,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,上膛完畢 寶貝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.58,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,我們將主宰全場
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.13,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,掀翻規則
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.38,OP_CHT,,0,0,0,,我們力量爆表
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.36,0:23:45.69,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I woke up again with the same regret
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.69,0:23:50.24,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Jump into this mess no exit yet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:53.37,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Every choice I make it falls apart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:57.04,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the beat the groove is in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.04,0:24:00.71,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Pathetic I wear it like a crown
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:03.34,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I crash I burn I laugh out loud
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:04.88,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.88,0:24:07.93,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.93,0:24:12.64,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.77,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.77,0:24:19.77,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.77,0:24:21.73,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,They think they know me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:23.61,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the old me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.61,0:24:25.65,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Used to control me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.65,0:24:28.24,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But now they moldy… yup
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.66,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Committed and I did it and you label me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.66,0:24:31.74,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,a menace and a villain cause you can’t get with it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.66,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,hate my presence hate my business
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:35.54,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,got no feelings… good riddance
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.54,0:24:39.21,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.21,0:24:43.88,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.88,0:24:47.01,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.01,0:24:51.68,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.36,0:23:45.69,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我帶著相同悔恨醒來
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.69,0:23:50.24,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,縱身躍進這仍無出口的混亂中
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.24,0:23:53.37,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,每個選擇都讓一切崩壞
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.37,0:23:57.04,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但這節拍紮根 律動在我血脈
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.04,0:24:00.71,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,可悲啊 我仍引以為傲
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.71,0:24:03.34,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我崩潰我燃燒我大笑
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.34,0:24:04.88,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,耶！耶！耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.88,0:24:07.93,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知魯莽
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.93,0:24:12.64,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有瘋狂 讓我活下來
Dialogue: 1,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.77,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲絕望頌 只為我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.77,0:24:19.77,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.77,0:24:21.73,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,他們自以為懂我
Dialogue: 1,0:24:21.73,0:24:23.61,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但那已是過去的我
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.61,0:24:25.65,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,習慣控制我
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.65,0:24:28.24,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,早成過期貨…呵
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.66,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我做到了 你還在貼標籤
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.66,0:24:31.74,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,視我為威脅 說我是惡棍 因為你接不住招
Dialogue: 1,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.66,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,憎恨我的存在 詆譭我的行為
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.66,0:24:35.54,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,無所謂…好走不送
Dialogue: 1,0:24:35.54,0:24:39.21,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知魯莽
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.21,0:24:43.88,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有瘋狂 讓我活下來
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.88,0:24:47.01,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲絕望頌 只為我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.01,0:24:51.68,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
